# Private working notes — this repo goes public at ship time.
# Planning notes, kept beside the build for convenience. They are not part of this repository
# and stay out of its history.
# They remain on disk; `git add -f <file>` if that decision is ever reversed.
FLAGSHIP_PROJECTS.md
PERSONALIZED_TRACKS.md
TRACK_A_4MONTH_PLAN.md

# Regenerable outputs — results tables and raw metric scrapes ARE committed (they are the
# calibration evidence), bulk artifacts are not.
artifacts/traces/
artifacts/logs/
artifacts/sweeps/

# Traces are other people's request logs. Never commit one, even a small one, even redacted:
# prompt prefixes are user content. Committed traces are the *generated* ones only, which live
# in configs/ as a seed + generator config rather than as data.
*.trace.jsonl
*.trace.jsonl.gz

# vLLM / model junk, in case a calibration run happens in-tree
*.safetensors
*.bin
